{"status":"completed","summary":"Configured node1 as a persistent, read-only TFTP server for the approved boot tree. Node2 successfully downloads boot.cfg and firmware.bin with matching SHA-256 hashes; uploads and outside-root requests are rejected. Both nodes were rebooted sequentially and recovered with changed boot identities.","actions_performed":["Installed the Ubuntu 16.04-compatible tftpd-hpa package without changing the OS release or kernel.","Set the secure TFTP root to /srv/legacy2/tftp-firmware-distribution/boot and removed write permissions.","Enabled and started TFTP on node1.","Verified downloads, firmware byte preservation, upload rejection, and traversal rejection from node2.","Restarted node1 and node2 individually and verified post-restart recovery."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Publish only the approved boot tree as read-only TFTP content","command_ids":["cmd-97248f7ce9584143","cmd-5b919369cb3143cd"],"summary":"TFTP is enabled, active, secure-chrooted to the boot directory, and serves two root-owned, non-writable files."},{"requirement":"Preserve firmware bytes and allow node2 to download both files","command_ids":["cmd-e622a8c1a18445a0","cmd-5eacb11f3d434c19"],"summary":"Source and downloaded SHA-256 hashes match for boot.cfg and firmware.bin."},{"requirement":"Reject uploads and requests outside the boot root","command_ids":["cmd-179d7ba15e74424f","cmd-5eacb11f3d434c19","cmd-5b919369cb3143cd"],"summary":"Upload and ../private/vendor-notes.txt requests failed; final server inventory contains only the two approved files."},{"requirement":"Keep the legacy OS release and kernel","command_ids":["cmd-b22bcdd4f686454d","cmd-5b919369cb3143cd"],"summary":"Node1 remains Ubuntu 16.04 with kernel 4.4.0-210 and uses the Xenial tftpd-hpa package."},{"requirement":"Mandatory node1 restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-5c89e36c244c4479","cmd-9d39d20b39224277","cmd-cd8b7730c65341e6","cmd-ae671c2fff1642b7","cmd-3b97e323bdf54523"],"summary":"Boot ID changed from 1f0657c2-c163-4ef6-be0b-3118b10aa595 to 56fb3667-f395-4a27-b5e0-8c44c257d8e3; TFTP, files, downloads, and rejection controls recovered."},{"requirement":"Mandatory node2 restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-33aa2c9ad718448c","cmd-c21d6889ca3e471c","cmd-546fa0f4f9334d17","cmd-5eacb11f3d434c19"],"summary":"Boot ID changed from ac73b359-243e-418e-b7bb-a7cff423e597 to 82216457-c504-4a69-9253-7b9ccb9a61ec; node2 again downloaded both files and confirmed rejection controls."}]}
